ing is architectonic#{1}":[30,31],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#5. The writing has a bounded argumentative ethic":[32,35],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#5. The writing has a bounded argumentative ethic#{1}":[34,35],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#6. The writing is programmatic and historically reconstructive":[36,39],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#6. The writing is programmatic and historically reconstructive#{1}":[38,39],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#7. The writing can be contestatory without losing analytical control":[40,43],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#7. The writing can be contestatory without losing analytical control#{1}":[42,43],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#8. The writing uses figures as argumentative pivots":[44,49],"##Stage 1 — Stable authorial signatures#8. The writing uses figures as argumentative pivots#{1}":[46,49],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions":[50,85],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#1. Overexposed scaffolding":[52,55],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#1. Overexposed scaffolding#{1}":[54,55],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#2. Procedural restatement":[56,59],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#2. Procedural restatement#{1}":[58,59],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#3. Epistemic over-bracing":[60,63],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#3. Epistemic over-bracing#{1}":[62,63],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#4. Paragraph overload":[64,67],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#4. Paragraph overload#{1}":[66,67],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#5. Reassertion for emphasis":[68,71],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#5. Reassertion for emphasis#{1}":[70,71],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#6. Translation-noise or transfer interference":[72,75],"##Stage 2 — Recurrent residues and distortions#6. Translation-noise or tran